# Binary image assets are hosted externally to keep the repository text-only
*.png
*.PNG
*.jpg
*.JPG
*.jpeg
*.JPEG
*.gif
*.GIF
*.webp
*.WEBP
*.bmp
*.BMP
*.ico
*.ICO
*.tif
*.TIF
*.tiff
*.TIFF
# Common design exports that should also live outside of git history
*.psd
*.PSD
*.ai
*.AI
*.heic
*.HEIC
*.raw
*.RAW
*.pdf
*.PDF
*.zip
*.ZIP
*.tar
*.gz
*.tgz
*.7z
*.rar
# If a text-based SVG is needed it can be added explicitly, but binaries are skipped by default
# Explicitly ignored logo asset that deploys outside of the repository
assets/treelogo.png
!assets/.gitkeep
